# backend service base url, prod environment
#
# Empty means "same origin": the admin bundle is served by a static server (nginx) whose
# host also proxies /api to the Spring service. Do not serve the bundle from the Spring
# application itself: its `SecurityHeadersFilter` answers every request with a
# `default-src 'none'` CSP, which would blank the page.
# Set an absolute URL only if the API lives on another origin, and then add a
# matching CORS rule on the backend ("satoken" must be an allowed header).
VITE_SERVICE_BASE_URL=

# other backend service base url, prod environment
VITE_OTHER_SERVICE_BASE_URL={}
